        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "8e9533dd-a7f4-3dc9-a215-cce09105032c",
                "word": "écoblanchiment",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "113b1633-60fd-41c3-b13d-904d21e28876",
                        "entry_id": "8e9533dd-a7f4-3dc9-a215-cce09105032c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "écoblanchiments"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a6f309df-5a07-32f5-a51e-e0910564e00a",
                        "entry_id": "8e9533dd-a7f4-3dc9-a215-cce09105032c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Procédé mercatique utilisé par une organisation dans le but de se donner une image écologique responsable."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c9b32e42-7bc0-4ffe-9a8b-9deaf7c8c7f7",
                                "sense_id": "a6f309df-5a07-32f5-a51e-e0910564e00a",
                                "text": "L’écoblanchiment, ou greenwashing en anglais, est l'utilisation abusive ou mensongère de l'argument écologique ou du développement durable dans la publicité, pour une marque, un produit ou une entreprise … Les annonceurs et les entreprises irresponsables qui pratiquent l'écoblanchiment considèrent la protection de l'environnement comme une \"mode verte\" source de business, et non pas une responsabilité individuelle et collective de préservation des ressources et du patrimoine naturel."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8405f2cd-f97b-40f4-99aa-be2f7f0e6229",
                                "sense_id": "a6f309df-5a07-32f5-a51e-e0910564e00a",
                                "text": "Elle veillera à améliorer l’information des consommateurs sur la durabilité des produits et mieux les protégés contre certaines pratiques comme l’écoblanchiment et l’obsolescence prématurée."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "efcfa405-f93b-4b47-ae82-725a7f39318b",
                                "sense_id": "a6f309df-5a07-32f5-a51e-e0910564e00a",
                                "text": "Mais, le 29 novembre 2022, une enquête sur les fonds d’investissement « verts », diligentée par une dizaine de médias européens dont Le Monde, a révélé une vaste entreprise d’écoblanchiment : une part considérable des placements présentés comme durables profite à des entreprises agissant dans le secteur du pétrole, du gaz, du charbon ou de l’aviation."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "18cb935c-741b-4cf2-8743-85137a115e0b",
                        "source_entry_id": "8e9533dd-a7f4-3dc9-a215-cce09105032c",
                        "source_sense_id": "a6f309df-5a07-32f5-a51e-e0910564e00a",
                        "target_lang_word": "Greenwashing",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Greenwashing",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5578742d-4ec5-3bd5-9cbe-1b0e4976b51b",
                                        "entry_id": "d91c8b72-63cd-3d11-bc1f-350cd8542918",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Marketingmethode von Unternehmen mit dem Ziel, sich ein falsches positives Image hinsichtlich Klima- und Umweltschutz zu verschaffen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62845452-8e0f-4155-8492-3de7996356cb",
                                                "sense_id": "5578742d-4ec5-3bd5-9cbe-1b0e4976b51b",
                                                "text": "„Hinzu kommen 2007 die Pläne der EU-Kommission, die Klimavorgaben für Autos abzumildern, dafür aber die höhere Beimischung von Biosprit anzurechnen: als Klimaschutz-Maßnahme. Plötzlich dient die Alternative zum Öl dem Greenwashing großer Spritfresser.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "deeb4bc1-43e7-4309-bf42-41ccf60d62b0",
                                                "sense_id": "5578742d-4ec5-3bd5-9cbe-1b0e4976b51b",
                                                "text": "„»Politiker und Politikerinnen wollen uns ihre Landwirtschaftspolitik als fürne Reform verkaufen, doch es ist nichts anderes als Greenwashing«, sagte Marco Contiero, Landwirtschaftsexperte vom Brüsseler Greenpeace-Büro.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "768bcd90-8850-4bc1-b9ff-a0fe6479366d",
                                                "sense_id": "5578742d-4ec5-3bd5-9cbe-1b0e4976b51b",
                                                "text": "„In manchen Branchen wird mit Siegeln regelrecht Greenwashing betrieben. Die Unternehmen versuchen so zum Beispiel, darüber hinwegzutäuschen, dass es kein umweltfreundliches Auto gibt. Und dass Fliegen auch dann nicht wirklich klimafreundlich wird, wenn die Lufthansa jetzt Bio-Kerosin nutzt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5fddb75-2853-4b1d-9e61-b1ba76e335db",
                                                "sense_id": "5578742d-4ec5-3bd5-9cbe-1b0e4976b51b",
                                                "text": "„Schnell drängt sich der Verdacht auf, dass die Supermarktkette mit der Aktion vor allem Greenwashing betreibt - also versucht, besonders umweltfreundlich zu erscheinen, ohne es tatsächlich zu sein.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2340d38b-289d-4897-a210-b81470b3ca1b",
                                                "sense_id": "5578742d-4ec5-3bd5-9cbe-1b0e4976b51b",
                                                "text": "»[…] Greta Thunberg war mit dem Ausgang der Konferenz nicht zufrieden. Die Aktivistin beschuldigte die Politiker des \"Greenwashings\".«"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51792c13-a0ef-4c98-b7f9-b7f6ed7aa5d1",
                                                "sense_id": "5578742d-4ec5-3bd5-9cbe-1b0e4976b51b",
                                                "text": "„»Nachhaltigkeit ist kein geschützter Begriff, da ist dem Greenwashing Tür und Tor geöffnet«, so Wohlgemuth.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3f522414-a6d2-4d0a-8321-6f2c6f212a9e",
                        "source_entry_id": "8e9533dd-a7f4-3dc9-a215-cce09105032c",
                        "source_sense_id": "a6f309df-5a07-32f5-a51e-e0910564e00a",
                        "target_lang_word": "greenwash",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "greenwash",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a125c510-c457-3d2a-a704-2f68f495e670",
                                        "entry_id": "a97d8623-f1ee-3446-9fa3-8a2ee699e8ee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A false or misleading picture of environmental friendliness used to conceal or obscure damaging activities."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7035c062-dfbf-4545-98a6-a773a57c6abb",
                                                "sense_id": "a125c510-c457-3d2a-a704-2f68f495e670",
                                                "text": "People can be cynical about companies hiding behind green ideals, their radars finely tuned to detect a greenwash."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "519d59f1-f899-4e4f-a774-061357b154b5",
                                                "sense_id": "a125c510-c457-3d2a-a704-2f68f495e670",
                                                "text": "Greta Thunberg has blasted politicians as hypocrites and international climate summits as empty words and greenwash."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "greenwash",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "88e87cc8-49b7-3ba7-9ec5-632bfdf6c0ed",
                                        "entry_id": "57239f56-5eb7-3c1b-97c6-bf37654e7ff8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To portray with a false or misleading image of environmental friendliness so as to conceal or obscure damaging activities."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0fa45be-6e2c-4abb-91b4-25ff455a8534",
                                                "sense_id": "88e87cc8-49b7-3ba7-9ec5-632bfdf6c0ed",
                                                "text": "But what happens more often is that media “greenwashes” dirty energy sources (coal, gas, nuclear power) as “clean”—a particularly dangerous notion because it belies the threat they pose to our planet and human health."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02449669-ae2a-4375-a91b-05ee93a43f5a",
                                                "sense_id": "88e87cc8-49b7-3ba7-9ec5-632bfdf6c0ed",
                                                "text": "The commercials were very effective – in 1990, they won an Effie advertising award, and subsequently became a case study at Harvard Business school. They also became notorious among environmentalists, who have proclaimed them the gold standard of greenwashing – the corporate practice of making diverting sustainability claims to cover a questionable environmental record."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09450ba5-3fa8-4c34-a2d2-b9276ca00e25",
                                                "sense_id": "88e87cc8-49b7-3ba7-9ec5-632bfdf6c0ed",
                                                "text": "WWF recommends including the following Clauses in the Bill to avoid potential loopholes: […] Provide clear and comprehensive definitions of “disposable” and “single-use” to avoid greenwashing and false claims for products designed to be disposable but falsely marketed otherwise to circumvent the ban."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0dd66600-5b77-49bb-bb3b-50579dedb648",
                        "source_entry_id": "8e9533dd-a7f4-3dc9-a215-cce09105032c",
                        "source_sense_id": "a6f309df-5a07-32f5-a51e-e0910564e00a",
                        "target_lang_word": "greenwashing",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "greenwashing",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7df959e2-a9d9-3391-8979-08ba990166bc",
                                        "entry_id": "80a0a0af-96c2-3697-9071-ff885b50beda",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The practice by people, organizations and states of presenting themselves as environmentally-friendly and progressive in order to disguise or divert attention away from their actual environmentally damaging behavior."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11978a92-ca4e-4ab8-9eb1-9dd0c35d0f58",
                                                "sense_id": "7df959e2-a9d9-3391-8979-08ba990166bc",
                                                "text": "Fossil fuel lobbyists are trying to water down planned EU rules to stop “investment greenwashing’ by setting science-based criteria for any investment which lays claim to being environmentally sustainable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b045160-1e4b-4f49-96ac-d9f2904ba7a2",
                                                "sense_id": "7df959e2-a9d9-3391-8979-08ba990166bc",
                                                "text": "It's not greenwashing - it makes sense for a whole load of reasons. It demonstrates that we are not just accepting that we have to use diesel for years to come."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2dfcc2b1-f704-41a4-a728-11b3dc718b10",
                                                "sense_id": "7df959e2-a9d9-3391-8979-08ba990166bc",
                                                "text": "In fact, no legal definition for “nontoxic” or “ceramic” exists, and the marketing has drawn greenwashing accusations exacerbated by the companies concealing their pans’ ingredients."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "greenwashing",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7bfc724b-d925-3ecf-869a-e20a712d8f3f",
                                        "entry_id": "226de69a-9f7c-325e-bc43-3d2319dc9eee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "present participle and gerund of greenwash"
